    <!-- Bottom tab bar icons — 24x24 viewbox, centred, ~20x20 live area.
         Home traces the desktop sidebar's Home PNG. Favorites and Search draw the desktop's glyphs (Noctis.UI Assets/Icons.axaml, copied
         verbatim). Playlists traces the desktop sidebar's Playlist icon.png the same way. Library keeps the
         phone's own: the desktop has no Library entry. Phone outline set = 1.8u stroke (round caps/joins) expanded to fill; filled set =
         same silhouette, interior details knocked out.
         Each string carries the grid's corners ("M0 0ZM24 24Z", zero-area) so PathIcon's
         uniform stretch keeps the 24-grid: one box size draws every tab at the same weight. -->

